  "prefLabel": "Mil 203.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mil 203.03 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The board shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. #7529, eff 7-12-01",
